build/
dist/
# The two patterns above are unanchored, so they also match nested `dist/`
# directories inside audiospectra-cli/node_modules (which is deliberately
# tracked in git, unlike a normal node_modules) - silently untracking any
# transitive dependency whose own build output happens to be named `dist`,
# breaking it the next time node_modules is regenerated and that untracked
# directory doesn't come back. Found via `vsce publish` crashing on a
# missing `cockatiel/dist` (and two others: @humanfs/core, @humanfs/node,
# http-proxy-agent) that used to be committed. Re-including them here does
# not affect audiospectra-cli's own `dist/` (its compiled extension output,
# correctly untracked) or web/.next, since those still match the bare
# patterns above - only paths inside this specific node_modules tree.
!audiospectra-cli/node_modules/**/dist/
bitefix.egg-info/
docs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
